Home: messenger bindings guarded by Home Manager's own link check; drop the one-migration pinned guard and force

The retireProvenLegacyMessengerBindings step admitted ~/.local/bin bindings
only from one pinned generated-files root (9ajs6aji) or the 0.2.5 shim
chain, so once a later generation (1039) owned the links every activation
refused. Without force, Home Manager's checkLinkTargets replaces links into
any Home Manager generation and refuses foreign files and links.

